<p><lb n="1"/><g ref="sym:doubleBar-crossed" type="punctuation">.</g> Ini pade<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">y</unclear>ānda havaṁ payaṁṅān∙ <g ref="sym:doubleBar-crossed" type="punctuation">.</g></p>
         </div>
