                     <lem>pade<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">y</unclear>ānda</lem>
                     <rdg source="bib:Casparis1956_01">paḍehānda</rdg>
					<rdg source="bib:Griffiths2013_01">padeyān da</rdg>
					<note>At present (2025), it seems more likely to me that De Casparis was right to interpret <foreign>da</foreign> as a suffix.</note>
